Polynomial -1 * log(10, 2) + (4 + x) * log(10, 4) + (3 + -4 * x) * log(10, 6) becomes 

x * (-4 * log(10, 6) + log(10, 4)) + (4 * log(10, 4) + -1 * log(10, 2) + 3 * log(10, 6)) when in normal form

